      "blocks": {
        "heading_MRNyVn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>How RX lenses help overall?</strong>",
            "set_h1": false,
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_znU3Wh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Whether your correction is “minus” or “plus,” the lens is simply bending light in the direction your eyes need so the focal point lands on the retina. That brings the whole scene into focus across common dive and snorkel distances. The nearsighted/farsighted labels just indicate which way we’re bending the light, not a limit on what you’ll see clearly.</h4>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
